    372  f19e							; RefreshEnemyY's idle-only guard never touches it during gameplay... its
    373  f19e							; gameplay latch writes StepsLeft only when DropTarget==0 — intro frames
    374  f19e							; have DropTarget=$FD so ownership stays clean).
    375  f19e							; Clobbers A/X/Temp. Ends at TitleTailAudio (silence + overscan wait).
    376  f19e							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
