    578  f44f							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    579  f44f							; TallyEntry — level-bonus tally body (moved from bank2 2026-10-20, repack
    580  f44f							; chunk 3: it touches ZP/TIA only, and the tally frame runs the bank1 HUD
    581  f44f							; anyway). Entered from bank0's TallyTramp ($FFE6) via jsr; tail-jmps
    582  f44f							; ReturnPad ($FBF8, bank1 copy) so A (and Z) survive back to the bank0 caller.
    583  f44f							;   DropTarget == 0 (pickup frame) -> ARM: snapshot the bonus into TallyTicks
    584  f44f							;     in 50-pt units — 20 = miner (1000), (BarLevel+3)/6 = remaining time
    585  f44f							;     (50% -> 10 ticks -> 500), 1/bomb, 2/life — then arm the 4-frame pace
    586  f44f							;     divider (TickCounter), clear jet/beam, set DropTarget = $FE.
    587  f44f							;   DropTarget == $FE (every frame) -> STEP: dec TickCounter; on 0 reload 4,
    588  f44f							;     dec TallyTicks. Event A: b0 = add 50, b1 = coin tone written here
    589  f44f							;     (AUDC/F/V + BombSnd=8; bank0 TallyWork's UpdateBombSound holds it,
    590  f44f							;     coin = every 4 ticks = 200 pts), b2 = done (last tick consumed).
    591  f44f							; The old hard `org $F313` pin and bank2's `org $F880` TallySum slot are gone
    592  f44f							; with the move; both bodies now flow in bank1's $F41F-$F53F fill.
    593  f44f							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
