   1308  f828							; ====================================================================
   1309  f828							; Pad remaining scanlines to reach exactly 48 total
   1310  f828							; Path A (PlayerLives > 0) — execution count:
   1311  f828							;   Top gap:  6 (4 + 2 former ball-pos lines — elements keep lines)
   1312  f828							;   Timer:    3 loop + 1 gap = 4
   1313  f828							;   Lives:    2 SetObjectXPos (P0 lives, P1 key) + 1 HMOVE + 5 render
   1314  f828							;	       + 1 gap = 9
   1315  f828							;   Bombs:    2 SetObjectXPos + 1 HMOVE + 5 render + 3 gap = 11
   1316  f828							;   Score:    2 SetObjectXPos + 1 HMOVE + 7 ScoreLoop = 10
   1317  f828							;   Subtotal: 6+4+9+11+10 = 40
   1318  f828							;   Pad:      48 - 40 = 8
   1319  f828							; Both lives paths run the same instructions (GRP0/GRP1 just stay 0),
   1320  f828							; so the band is 48 lines for every lives count and every key state.
   1321  f828							; ====================================================================
