   1631  fa26							; GetConnIdx RETIRED (C3, 2026-10-20): the four exit handlers moved to
   1632  fa26							; bank2 and read the connection record in-bank (LevelConnB2), so this pad's
   1633  fa26							; body had no caller. Deleting it (plus the bank0 `sta` half and this bank's
   1634  fa26							; `jmp` half) reclaimed 15 B here and removed a live-but-uncalled pad.
